  "description": "Buildersoft Cortex Mediator is a library for .NET applications that implements the mediator pattern. It helps to reduce dependencies between objects by allowing in-process messaging without direct communication. Instead, objects communicate through Cortex Mediator, making them less coupled and more maintainable..",
